{# Decision template: which strategy one NPC in a SexLab mini-game scene starts using right now, as one choice
   over the strategies the engine allows. Sent by SkyrimNet_SexLab.dll (StrategyDecision.cpp) through
   PublicSendCustomDecisionToLLM: for every NPC when the scene starts, for the speaker after each line an
   NPC in the scene speaks, and for an NPC just asked, ordered or punished (the answer is narrated by the game
   as its own line afterwards). Rendered into a decisions request, never into chat messages.

   Context pushed by the game (C++ snapshot): trigger (scene_start | dialogue | asked | ordered | punished),
   focus_uuid, focus_name, last_line_text (the ask / order narration, the spoken line, or for a punishment
   "<act>. <feeling>, because <reason>."; above 80% torture the game makes the focus submit without asking),
   role, arousal, orgasms, expects_orgasm, timeline [lines, oldest first: speech, thoughts, narrations and other
   events of the focus actor, narration inside speech on its own line], partners [uuid, name, is_player, role,
   arousal, orgasms, relationship, relationship_rank], options [key, text], current_key (the options key in use,
   set only when punished; "" otherwise).
   The current strategy is shown only for a punishment. Keys are read back by the game: keep {{ o.key }} as given.
   A criterion is one line; profiles and other multi-line decorators belong in the state blocks. #}
{% set _focus = decnpc(focus_uuid) %}
[ state focus ]
{{ focus_name }}, {{ _focus.gender }} {{ _focus.race }}, is the {{ role }} in this scene{% if not expects_orgasm %} (this act is not expected to bring {{ focus_name }} to orgasm){% endif %}.
{{ focus_name }} is {{ arousal }}{% if orgasms > 0 %} and has climaxed {{ orgasms }} time{% if orgasms > 1 %}s{% endif %} so far{% endif %}.
{{ render_character_profile("short_inline", focus_uuid) }}
[ end state ]

[ state scene ]
{% set _sexlab = sexlab_get_threads(focus_uuid) %}
{% if existsIn(_sexlab, "threads") %}
{% for thread in _sexlab.threads %}
{% for actor_record in thread.actors %}
{% if to_number(actor_record.uuid) == focus_uuid %}
{% if existsIn(thread, "location") and thread.location != "" %}On {{ thread.location }}, {% endif %}{{ thread.description }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ state partners ]
{% for p in partners %}
{{ p.name }}: the {{ p.role }}, {{ p.arousal }}{% if p.orgasms > 0 %}, climaxed {{ p.orgasms }} time{% if p.orgasms > 1 %}s{% endif %}{% endif %}. {{ focus_name }} and {{ p.name }} are {{ p.relationship }}.
- {{ render_character_profile("short_inline", p.uuid) }}
{% endfor %}
[ end state ]

[ state timeline ]
{% if length(timeline) > 0 %}
{% for line in timeline %}
{{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Nothing has happened yet.
{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ state last_line ]
{% if trigger == "punished" %}{{ last_line_text }}
{% if current_key != "" %}{{ focus_name }} is being punished for what they are doing now (`{{ current_key }}`). Keeping it invites more punishment; changing it may make it stop.{% else %}{{ focus_name }} is being punished for what they are doing now; changing it may make it stop.{% endif %}
{% else if trigger == "asked" or trigger == "ordered" %}{{ last_line_text }}{% else if trigger == "dialogue" and last_line_text != "" %}{{ focus_name }} just said: "{{ last_line_text }}"{% else %}The scene has just begun; {{ focus_name }} has not spoken during it yet.{% endif %}
[ end state ]

[ question strategy choice ]
Decide which strategy {{ focus_name }} decides to start using right now.
Base it on their relationship with each partner (`partners`), what is happening (`scene`), and what {{ focus_name }} has thought, said and experienced (`timeline`).
In order of importance: `last_line`, {{ focus_name }}'s thoughts, and recent events over older events. {{ focus_name }}'s words are more about changing other people's behavior than describing {{ focus_name }}'s own desires.
A victim who is resisting does not cooperate. A lover or friend who is lagging behind may be helped. A rival or enemy is unlikely to be generous.
{% if trigger == "punished" %}
After a punishment, decide whether {{ focus_name }} gives in and changes, or defies and keeps {% if current_key != "" %}`{{ current_key }}`{% else %}what they are doing{% endif %}. Defiance gets rarer with each punishment in `timeline`; someone who fears or serves the punisher usually gives in.
{% endif %}
[ criteria ]
{% for o in options %}
{{ o.key }}: {{ o.text }}
{% endfor %}
[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]
